#: screens/sui_menu.lua:4320
msgid ""
"Global scale applied to all of KOReader's interface text — menus, dialogs, titles, and Simple UI. It does not change the book's reading font size, which has its own setting.\n"
"100% is the default size. Useful when a chosen UI font (see UI Font above) renders smaller or larger than usual."
